  "title": "Mushroom and Artichoke Soup",
  "description": "Need to feed 50 vegetarians? This delicious soup (and there is lots of it) is full of artichoke hearts, white mushrooms, dried portobello mushrooms, red onion, shallots, and carrots. A great recipe for a big party.",
  "authors": [
    "Eleanor Lorie Peowie Policastr"
  ],
